  <li><p>
a cofiltered index category $\mathcal{I}$, 
</p>
</li><li><p>
for $i \in \mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{I})$ a site $\mathcal{C}_ i$ such that every covering in $\mathcal{C}_ i$ has a finite index set, 
</p>
