for a morphism $a : i \to j$ in $\mathcal{I}$ a morphism of sites $f_ a : \mathcal{C}_ i \to \mathcal{C}_ j$ given by a continuous functor $u_ a : \mathcal{C}_ j \to \mathcal{C}_ i$, 
</p>
</li>
